OL,3,GNEWSAPlans in for #6m leisure centre in
OL,4,Adeprived area
OL,5,
OL,6,FNew plans have been submitted for a #6m
OL,7,Frefurbishment of a leisure centre in
OL,8,Fone of the most deprived areas of
OL,9,FDevon.
OL,11,FDiscussions about the future of Wonford
OL,12,FSports Centre and Community and
OL,13,FLearning Centre have been going on for
OL,14,Fat least seven years.
OL,16,FPlans were approved in February 2025
OL,17,Fbut Exeter City Council has now
OL,18,Fsubmitted a revised application for a
OL,19,F"more compact building" to "ensure that
OL,20,Fthe leisure centre and its associated
OL,21,Fbenefits can be successfully delivered"
OL,22,Ffor the available budget.
OL,23,APub: 03-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageBW-SW Eng NewsC Reg TVFWeather
FL,346,340,200,160,0,100
