OL,3,GNEWSAPlans in for #6m leisure centre in
OL,4,Adeprived area
OL,5,
OL,6,FThe existing gym, the Phoenix Centre
OL,7,Fand outdoor changing rooms will all be
OL,8,Fdemolished under the plans with a new
OL,9,Fhub, a cafe area, changing facilities,
OL,10,Fstudio, gym and refurbished sports
OL,11,Fhall.
